Matt 21:1 , Christ rides into Jerusalem upon an ass;
Matt 21:12 , drives the buyers and sellers out of the temple;
Matt 21:17 , curses the fig-tree;
Matt 21:23 , puts to silence the priests and elders
Matt 21:28 . and rebukes them by the similitude of the two sons
Matt 21:33 . and the husbandmen who slew such as were sent to them.
